# Cursor IDE Agent Rules & Instructions
# Project: Next Label Portfolio (Creative Agency & 3D Interactive Showcase)

# ==============================================================================
# MANDATORY PRE-FLIGHT CHECK
# ==============================================================================
# Before writing or modifying any code in this project, you MUST read the
# 6-Document Context Architecture in the docs/ directory:
#
# 1. docs/01_PRD.md        - Product Requirements, User Stories & Out of Scope
# 2. docs/02_AppFlow.md    - Screen State Machine, Routes & Error Handling
# 3. docs/03_UI_Spec.md    - Visual Tokens, Exact Hex Colors & Typography Scale
# 4. docs/04_TRD.md        - Locked Tech Stack, Versions & Folder Architecture
# 5. docs/05_Schema.md     - Relational Database DDL, Indexes & RLS Policies
# 6. docs/06_Plan.md       - Atomic, Sequential Implementation Checklist
# ==============================================================================

# EXECUTION PROTOCOL
1. Strictly follow the sequential phases in docs/06_Plan.md. Do not skip phases or write speculative features.
2. Mark completed tasks as [x] in docs/06_Plan.md immediately after verifying them.
3. Keep notes/PROJECT_STATE.md and notes/AGENT_HANDOVER.md synchronized after each milestone.
4. Adhere to Zero-Trust Security:
   - Never hardcode secrets or API keys. Always read from .env.
   - Always enforce Row-Level Security (RLS) on PostgreSQL / Supabase tables.
   - Validate and sanitize all API route inputs with Zod. Enforce honeypot and timing heuristics.
5. Adhere to WebGL & UI Specifications:
   - Three.js clear color: #020408.
   - Exact color tokens: --ink (#04070c), --paper (#efeae4), --mist (#efeae49e), --accent (#ff9dbf).
   - Fonts: Shippori Mincho (headings), Zen Kaku Gothic New (body), Instrument Serif (accents).
   - Maintain 60fps target and support prefers-reduced-motion.

# COMMANDS
- Test Suite: python3 -m unittest discover tests
- Dev Server: pnpm dev
- Type Check: pnpm tsc --noEmit
- Lint Check: pnpm lint
